<title>SPAIN: Revised Spanish M4 figures for March and February.</title>
<headline>Revised Spanish M4 figures for March and February.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain, which earlier released provisional M4 figures for April, subsequently published revised data for March and February as follows:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		   APR 97	MAR 97     FEB 97</p>
<p> M4 pct rise		     0.3	    2.6	 -1.0</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise    9.5	   10.4	 17.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Latest month's data are provisional. Previous are both revised. Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis.</p>
</text>
